UID:165645@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20261010T120752Z
DTSTART:20261009T184600Z
SUMMARY:Calculation of Qualified Capacity for the Forward Capacity Market Monthly Capacity Supply Obligation Bilateral Window for December 2026
DESCRIPTION:In accordance with Market Rule 1 Section III.13\, the updated Qualified Capacity for each Resource for December 2026 is available for viewing in the Forward Capacity Tracking System (FCTS) under the Resource Position Summary. The amount of capacity that each Resource may transfer or acquire in the Forward Capacity Market Capacity Supply Obligation Bilateral Window for December 2026 is available for viewing in the Forward Capacity Market CSO Bilateral Contract Management UI under the terms Max Transferring Capacity and Max Acquiring Capacity.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165645
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165645
END:VEVENT
