BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:165362@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20261010T120752Z
DTSTART:20261027T170000Z
DTEND:20261027T190000Z
SUMMARY:Winter Generator Readiness Seminar
LOCATION:MS Teams
DESCRIPTION:This online seminar will give generating resources the coming winter season’s outlook. Presenters from ISO New England’s System Operations team will review changes to programs\, procedures\, and preparations that are in place to strengthen readiness for operations during cold weather in New England.\n\nWe are holding this seminar online. Virtual seating is limited to 200. Registration is available through ISO-TEN and is open until the time of the seminar.\n\nRegister here.\n\nOnce logged into ISO-TEN\, you will be registered. The registration confirmation\, seminar information and webinar link will be emailed to you.\n\nEmail the operations training team at operationstraining@iso-ne.com with any additional questions.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165362
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165362
END:VEVENT
